# Holds a real password for the end-to-end tests. Listed explicitly because it does NOT match the
# `*.local` rule above — .env.e2e.example is the committed template.
.env.e2e

# Generated by the TanStack Router plugin/CLI from src/routes/. Regenerated by `tsr generate` in the
# build/typecheck/dev scripts, so it's never committed — this guarantees a clean checkout can never
# typecheck against a stale route tree (which would let a newly-added route silently 404).
src/routeTree.gen.ts

